  "description": "The Caferacer Lady Doppio bike features a lightweight welded Cromoly steel frame with a traditional “mixte” shape with the signature double top tube. It has all the features you need to ride every day with speed and comfort. Equipped with a Brooks leather Brooks Cambium saddle praised for its style and durability and comfy Creme gummy grips with Alloy Bar-Ends. The unique front rack is very practical - you can keep your eyes on your precious bag at all times. A maintenance-free 7-speed Shimano Nexus internal gear hub will make traveling easy in any kind of terrain. It has a retro style crank with forged alloy chainring, hammered fenders, and a custom Creme high polished headset. Safety at night thanks to high-end dynamo-powered front and rear LED lights. A luxurious gloss paint in Pinot Noir, Silver Champagne, and Onyx.",
